const navItems=[['⌂','Overview'],['▣','Appointments'],['♙','Patients'],['✚','Digital Prescriptions'],['□','Pharmacy'],['₨','Payments & Billing'],['◇','CRM & Leads'],['↻','Follow-ups'],['◫','Treatment Plans'],['☆','Promotions'],['◌','WhatsApp AI Inbox'],['⌁','Analytics'],['⚙','Settings']];
const demoAppointments=[
 {time:'10:00',ampm:'AM',name:'Hira Salman',id:'PT-1048',service:'Skin Consultation',status:'Completed',color:'#dbece6'},
 {time:'11:30',ampm:'AM',name:'Maha Raza',id:'PT-1112',service:'HydraFacial',status:'In consultation',color:'#f1e7db'},
 {time:'01:00',ampm:'PM',name:'Areeba Khan',id:'PT-1087',service:'Acne Treatment',status:'Waiting',color:'#e7e2f3'},
 {time:'02:30',ampm:'PM',name:'Sana Malik',id:'PT-1156',service:'Laser Hair Reduction',status:'Confirmed',color:'#e4edf5'},
 {time:'04:00',ampm:'PM',name:'Mehak Noor',id:'PT-1191',service:'PRP Therapy',status:'Pending',color:'#f6e5dc'}
];
const queue=[{token:'A-12',name:'Areeba Khan',doctor:'Dr. Amna',wait:'18 min'},{token:'A-13',name:'Iqra Javed',doctor:'Dr. Amna',wait:'9 min'},{token:'Z-04',name:'Nida Ali',doctor:'Dr. Zoya',wait:'4 min'}];
const saved=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('skinuviaAppointments')||'[]');
const allAppointments=[...saved,...demoAppointments];

function initials(name){return name.split(' ').map(x=>x[0]).slice(0,2).join('').toUpperCase()}
function renderNav(){document.querySelector('#nav').innerHTML=navItems.map((x,i)=>`<button class="${i===0?'active':''}" data-label="${x[1]}"><span>${x[0]}</span><span>${x[1]}</span></button>`).join('')}
function renderStats(){const stats=[['▣','Today’s appointments',allAppointments.length,'+3 from yesterday','#e2f1eb','#317a62'],['◷','Waiting patients',queue.length,'Avg. wait 11 min','#fff0e8','#c76e44'],['₨','Collected today','PKR 48,500','↑ 8.2% this week','#ebe8f7','#7665a3'],['◌','WhatsApp inquiries',12,'2 need handoff','#e5edf7','#55789c']];document.querySelector('#statsGrid').innerHTML=stats.map(s=>`<article class="stat-card" style="--tint:${s[4]};--accent:${s[5]}"><span class="stat-icon">${s[0]}</span><small>${s[1]}</small><div class="stat-value"><strong>${s[2]}</strong><span class="delta ${s[1].includes('Waiting')?'orange':''}">${s[3]}</span></div></article>`).join('')}
function renderTimeline(list=allAppointments){document.querySelector('#timeline').innerHTML=list.length?list.map(a=>`<div class="appointment-row"><div class="appointment-time"><strong>${a.time}</strong><small>${a.ampm||''}</small></div><div class="patient"><span class="patient-avatar" style="--avatar:${a.color||'#dfeee8'}">${initials(a.name)}</span><span><strong>${a.name}</strong><small>${a.id||'NEW PATIENT'}</small></span></div><span class="service">${a.service}</span><span class="status ${(a.status||'').toLowerCase().split(' ')[0]}">${a.status}</span><button class="row-menu" data-toast="Patient details opened">⋮</button></div>`).join(''):'<p style="color:var(--muted);text-align:center;padding:30px">No matching appointments</p>'}
function renderQueue(){document.querySelector('#queueList').innerHTML=queue.map(q=>`<div class="queue-item"><span class="token">${q.token}</span><span><strong>${q.name}</strong><small>${q.doctor}</small></span><span class="wait-time">${q.wait}</span></div>`).join('')}
function renderChart(){const a=[54,70,58,84,66,91,73],b=[62,66,68,72,76,80,84];document.querySelector('#chart').innerHTML=a.map((v,i)=>`<div class="bar-group"><div class="bar" style="height:${v}%"></div><div class="bar target" style="height:${b[i]}%"></div><span class="bar-label">${['Mon','Tue','Wed','Thu','Fri','Sat','Sun'][i]}</span></div>`).join('')}
function updateClock(){const now=new Date();document.querySelector('#pkDate').textContent=new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-PK',{timeZone:'Asia/Karachi',weekday:'short',day:'2-digit',month:'short'}).format(now);document.querySelector('#pkTime').textContent=new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-PK',{timeZone:'Asia/Karachi',hour:'numeric',minute:'2-digit',second:'2-digit',hour12:true}).format(now)+' PKT'}
function toast(msg){const el=document.querySelector('#toast');el.textContent='✓  '+msg;el.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(window.toastTimer);window.toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>el.classList.remove('show'),2600)}
function openModal(type='appointment'){const title=type==='walkin'?'Add walk-in patient':'New appointment';document.querySelector('#modalTitle').textContent=title;const form=document.querySelector('#clinicForm');form.dataset.type=type;const d=new Date(Date.now()+864e5);form.date.value=d.toLocaleDateString('en-CA',{timeZone:'Asia/Karachi'});document.querySelector('#modalBackdrop').hidden=false;setTimeout(()=>form.patient.focus(),60)}
function closeModal(){document.querySelector('#modalBackdrop').hidden=true;document.querySelector('#clinicForm').reset()}

renderNav();renderStats();renderTimeline();renderQueue();renderChart();updateClock();setInterval(updateClock,1000);
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const action=e.target.closest('[data-action]');if(action)openModal(action.dataset.action);const t=e.target.closest('[data-toast]');if(t)toast(t.dataset.toast);const nav=e.target.closest('nav button');if(nav){document.querySelectorAll('nav button').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));nav.classList.add('active');if(nav.dataset.label!=='Overview')toast(`${nav.dataset.label} module is planned for the next build phase`);document.querySelector('#sidebar').classList.remove('open')}});
document.querySelector('#closeModal').onclick=closeModal;document.querySelector('#cancelModal').onclick=closeModal;document.querySelector('#modalBackdrop').onclick=e=>{if(e.target.id==='modalBackdrop')closeModal()};
document.querySelector('#clinicForm').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();if(!e.target.reportValidity())return;const data=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.target));const time=new Date(`2000-01-01T${data.time}`).toLocaleTimeString('en-US',{hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit',hour12:true}).split(' ');saved.unshift({time:time[0],ampm:time[1],name:data.patient,id:'NEW',service:data.service,status:e.target.dataset.type==='walkin'?'Waiting':'Confirmed',color:'#dfeee8',phone:data.phone,date:data.date,doctor:data.doctor,notes:data.notes});localStorage.setItem('skinuviaAppointments',JSON.stringify(saved));allAppointments.unshift(saved[0]);renderTimeline();renderStats();closeModal();toast(e.target.dataset.type==='walkin'?'Walk-in saved and queued':'Appointment saved successfully')};
document.querySelector('#globalSearch').oninput=e=>{const q=e.target.value.toLowerCase();renderTimeline(allAppointments.filter(a=>[a.name,a.id,a.service,a.status].join(' ').toLowerCase().includes(q)))};
document.querySelector('#themeBtn').onclick=()=>{document.body.classList.toggle('dark');localStorage.setItem('skinuviaTheme',document.body.classList.contains('dark')?'dark':'light')};if(localStorage.getItem('skinuviaTheme')==='dark')document.body.classList.add('dark');
document.querySelector('#menuBtn').onclick=()=>document.querySelector('#sidebar').classList.toggle('open');
document.querySelector('#callNext').onclick=()=>{if(queue.length){const next=queue.shift();renderQueue();toast(`${next.token} · ${next.name} called`)}else toast('Queue is clear')};
document.querySelector('#exportBtn').onclick=()=>{const payload={clinic:'Skinuvia by Dr. Amna Iqbal',timezone:'Asia/Karachi',exportedAt:new Date().toISOString(),appointments:allAppointments};const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify(payload,null,2)],{type:'application/json'}));const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='skinuvia-report.json';a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(url);toast('Report exported')};
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if((e.ctrlKey||e.metaKey)&&e.key==='k'){e.preventDefault();document.querySelector('#globalSearch').focus()}if(e.key==='Escape')closeModal()});
